WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.005 --> 00:00:23.965
Tom hurried to the Royal Lab.

2
00:00:23.965 --> 00:00:28.498
"Cat, I must make a powder for Cook," he said.

3
00:00:28.498 --> 00:00:30.382
"It must work.

4
00:00:30.382 --> 00:00:33.888
Or Dirk will lock us in the Grim Dungeon!"

5
00:00:33.888 --> 00:00:37.733
"Tom, you have a good heart," Cat said.

6
00:00:37.733 --> 00:00:40.839
"I will help you."

7
00:00:40.839 --> 00:00:56.593
She helped Tom make a magic powder.

8
00:00:56.593 --> 00:01:01.404
"This should work," she said.

9
00:01:01.404 --> 00:01:11.619
The guests began to arrive at the castle.

10
00:01:11.620 --> 00:01:15.516
In the Royal Kitchen, Cook was tasting a sauce.

11
00:01:15.515 --> 00:01:19.498
"My sauce!" she cried.

12
00:01:19.499 --> 00:01:22.839
"It tastes terrible!"

13
00:01:22.839 --> 00:01:25.460
"Try this!" Tom said.

14
00:01:25.460 --> 00:01:31.097
He sprinkled magic powder into the sauce.

15
00:01:31.098 --> 00:01:35.182
A delicious smell filled the kitchen.

16
00:01:35.182 --> 00:01:42.875
"Wonderful!" Cook cried.

17
00:01:42.875 --> 00:01:45.415
"Put some on the vegetables.

18
00:01:45.415 --> 00:01:50.202
And the bread. And the meat. And the cake!"

19
00:01:50.202 --> 00:02:03.305
Tom sprinkled magic powder on everything.

20
00:02:03.305 --> 00:02:11.946
Even Dirk smiled when he smelled the food.

21
00:02:11.946 --> 00:02:16.584
The servants took the food to the Dining Hall.

22
00:02:16.584 --> 00:02:19.877
Tom and Cook peeked through the door.

23
00:02:19.878 --> 00:02:25.426
The king took the first bite. "Delicious!"

24
00:02:25.426 --> 00:02:28.866
The guests started to eat too.

25
00:02:28.866 --> 00:02:32.325
"Delicious!" they said.

26
00:02:32.325 --> 00:02:35.639
"The powder works!" Tom said.

27
00:02:35.639 --> 00:02:38.243
He was shocked.

28
00:02:38.243 --> 00:02:41.329
"Thank you, Tom," Cook said.

29
00:02:41.329 --> 00:02:47.155
The guests ate and ate.

30
00:02:47.155 --> 00:02:50.200
They finished all the food.

31
00:02:50.200 --> 00:03:02.231
The servants brought in cake for dessert.

32
00:03:02.231 --> 00:03:11.454
The guests ate that too.

33
00:03:11.454 --> 00:03:18.103
"Everything tastes so good!" the king cried.

34
00:03:18.103 --> 00:03:23.283
"Bring more food!"
